{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Tribes\u00a0</strong>is a real-time strategy game where survival means outsmarting, outgrowing, and out-fighting every other tribe on the island. Can you rise from humble beginnings to build the strongest army, or will your people be wiped out by rival clans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with just a small group of villagers. Gather resources, construct buildings, and train warriors as you grow your settlement into a thriving, battle-hardened tribe. Every choice matters\u2014will you expand quickly, build up powerful defenses, or strike first and crush your enemies before they gain strength?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Conquer</strong> \u2013 Grow your village, manage your resources, and raise a powerful army.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time Battles</strong> \u2013 Take command in fast-paced skirmishes where every move counts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player Campaign</strong> \u2013 Battle against ruthless AI tribes in a challenging, evolving world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Changing terrain, weather, and events keep every game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribal Warfare</strong> \u2013 Unlock unique units and abilities to shape your tribe\u2019s destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Discord Server for updates regarding the game!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Catastrophe Studios<strong>,</strong><i>\u00a0Tribes</i> brings classic RTS gameplay with a fresh competitive twist. Only the strongest tribe will survive. Will it be yours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in version Beta 0.1.0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/sto