d events keep every game fresh.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tribal Warfare</strong> \u2013 Unlock unique units and abilities to shape your tribe\u2019s destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the Discord Server for updates regarding the game!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed by Catastrophe Studios<strong>,</strong><i>\u00a0Tribes</i> brings classic RTS gameplay with a fresh competitive twist. Only the strongest tribe will survive. Will it be yours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in version Beta 0.1.0</p>","developers":["Catastrophe Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551950/aa5a4ae2250d885b612084f50b1321e0c3c5944e/header.jpg?t=1760218544","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<strong>COPYRIGHT</strong><br><br>\u00a9 2025 Catastrophe Studios. All rights reserved. Tribes.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551950/853976520/b5748c3f47c3163efb30d2b9e5fedf4a9a59737a/1750859978/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749072936","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551950/853976520/b5748c3f47c3163efb30d2b9e5fedf4a9a59737a/1750859978/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749072936","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3551950/853976520/b5748c3f47c3163efb